        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Everson Walls, Randy White, Ed \"Too Tall\" Jones\n- Organizations: Grambling State University, Dallas Cowboys, Los Angeles Rams\n- Places: Grambling, Louisiana, Dallas\n- Events: 1983 Dallas Cowboys season, 1983 Los Angeles Rams season, NFL playoffs\n\nFacts:\n- Grambling State University is a historically black, public, coeducational university located in Grambling, Louisiana.\n- Everson Walls played college football at Grambling State University.\n- During the 1983 Dallas Cowboys season, Everson Walls, Randy White, and Ed \"Too Tall\" Jones were noted for strong defensive play even though the defense gave up many points.\n- During the 1983 Los Angeles Rams season playoffs, the Los Angeles Rams defeated the Dallas Cowboys 24-17 in Dallas to advance to the Divisional Round.",
